f,"}, {"s": 85.636, "e": 86.316, "t": "but it's a strong"}, {"s": 86.416, "e": 86.756, "t": "clue."}, {"s": 87.096, "e": 87.736, "t": "Just don't load it"}, {"s": 87.776, "e": 88.556, "t": "with tons of sugar"}, {"s": 88.596, "e": 89.176, "t": "and cream."}, {"s": 105.348, "e": 106.088, "t": "Plot twist!"}, {"s": 106.348, "e": 107.468, "t": "Coffee doesn't really dry"}, {"s": 107.508, "e": 107.948, "t": "you out."}, {"s": 108.228, "e": 108.888, "t": "In one study,"}, {"s": 109.008, "e": 110.168, "t": "men drank either coffee"}, {"s": 110.208, "e": 111.268, "t": "or water for days,"}, {"s": 111.368, "e": 112.288, "t": "and their hydration was"}, {"s": 112.328, "e": 113.108, "t": "about the same."}, {"s": 113.388, "e": 114.148, "t": "So your morning cup"}, {"s": 114.228, "e": 114.908, "t": "still counts as a"}, {"s": 114.928, "e": 115.268, "t": "drink."}, {"s": 115.528, "e": 116.308, "t": "Just stop by mid"}, {"s": 116.388, "e": 117.208, "t": "afternoon if you want"}, {"s": 117.228, "e": 118.188, "t": "to sleep well tonight."}, {"s": 133.76, "e": 134.4, "t": "How many cups do"}, {"s": 134.42, "e": 135.1, "t": "you drink a day?"}, {"s": 135.38, "e": 135.78, "t": "Tell me in the"}, {"s": 135.82, "e": 136.26, "t": "comments,"}, {"s": 136.34, "e": 137.3, "t": "and subscribe for more"}, {"s": 137.34, "e": 137.92, "t": "HowCome!"}]